(9. Grading and Pass Criteria) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
(The total mark for the course is 150 \(50 CIE + 100 ESE\). A student passes the course by) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
(securing at least 40 percent in the End Semester Examination and at least 45 percent of the) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
(aggregate of CIE and ESE marks. Letter grades are awarded on a 10-point scale: S \(90 percent) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
(and above\), A+ \(85-89\), A \(80-84\), B+ \(70-79\), B \(60-69\), C \(50-59\), P \(45-49\) and F \(below) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf
(45\).) Tj T*
